Subject: [PATCH] Gate editor breakpoint affordances with the extension context

The extension owns the access mode and sets arara.ui.hideAdvanced. The public
extension API cannot suppress native breakpoint glyphs, hover hints or gutter
mouse handlers without removing user breakpoints. This generic context gate
preserves breakpoint ranges and debug state while hiding editor affordances.

Touches: src/vs/workbench/contrib/debug/browser/breakpointEditorContribution.ts

